  "label": "Brisnik HR-E2",
  "family": "BRISNIK",
  "title": "Antidepressant with two further serotonergic medicines",
  "statement": "Prescribed SSRI, SNRI, or TCA (in doses ≥ 50 mg/day) - and the patient is co-prescribed ≥ 2 further serotonergic drugs other than tranylcypromine (e.g., tramadol, fentanyl, triptans, metoclopramide, another serotonergic antidepressant)",
